{"say": "@Coordination Wrote #races (three .j2-card race cards, Rs 250 T-shirt note, early-bird note) and #calculator (calc-race, calc-runners, calc-shirts, calc-early, calc-total); no form tag and no .j2-btn-primary used.", "next": "Coordination", "reason": "Section is written to the declared outputs and constraints, so Coordination can schedule the next workflow."}

```section
<section id="races" aria-labelledby="races-title">
<style>
.j2-rc-lead{color:var(--j2-muted)}
.j2-rc-card h3{margin:0 0 8px}
.j2-rc-fee{font-family:var(--j2-font-heading);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,8vw,3rem);line-height:1;color:var(--j2-primary);margin:0}
.j2-rc-fee-label{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--j2-muted);margin:4px 0 16px}
.j2-rc-facts{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.j2-rc-facts li{padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--j2-border);font-weight:500}
.j2-rc-facts li::first-letter{text-transform:uppercase}
.j2-rc-shirt{margin-top:24px;padding:16px 20px;border-left:6px solid var(--j2-accent);background:var(--j2-surface);border-radius:var(--j2-radius)}
.j2-rc-shirt p{margin:0}
.j2-rc-shirt p+p{margin-top:8px}
.j2-rc-calc{background:var(--j2-surface)}
.j2-rc-layout{display:grid;gap:24px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));align-items:start}
.j2-rc-layout>*{min-width:0}
.j2-rc-panel,.j2-rc-result{background:var(--j2-background);border:1px solid var(--j2-border);border-radius:var(--j2-radius);padding:24px;color:var(--j2-text)}
.j2-rc-result{border:2px solid var(--j2-primary)}
.j2-rc-panel label.j2-rc-early{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0 0 8px}
.j2-rc-panel label.j2-rc-early input[type=checkbox]{width:44px;height:44px;flex:none}
.j2-rc-note{font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--j2-muted);margin:0 0 16px}
.j2-rc-msg{margin:0;font-weight:600}
.j2-rc-msg:not(:empty){padding:8px 12px;border-left:6px solid var(--j2-accent);background:var(--j2-surface)}
.j2-rc-result h3{margin:0 0 8px}
.j2-rc-rows{margin:0}
.j2-rc-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 16px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--j2-border)}
.j2-rc-row[hidden]{display:none}
.j2-rc-row dt{margin:0;font-weight:500}
.j2-rc-row dd{margin:0;font-weight:700}
